@startuml rvdroid_action_generation
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam useBetaStyle true

title RVDroid Action Generation Process

|UI State Capture|
start
:Capture UI hierarchy via UIAutomator;
:Parse XML structure;
:Map to UI elements;
:Take screenshot (if enabled);

|State Analysis|
:Analyze UI state;
:Identify interactive elements;
:Detect screen type;
:Extract text features;
:Evaluate security relevance;

|Context Analysis|
:Access memory system;
:Retrieve state history;
:Determine application context;
:Identify current task;
:Analyze navigation patterns;

|Opportunity Detection|
:Identify testing opportunities;
:Match with monitored methods;
:Rate opportunities by relevance;
:Prioritize security-sensitive paths;

|Strategy Selection|
:Check LLM directives (if any);
:Evaluate strategy effectiveness;
:Select appropriate strategy;
if (Strategy needs LLM guidance?) then (yes)
  :Consult LLM for guidance;
endif

|Action Selection|
:Strategy generates action candidates;
:Apply memory-based recommendations;
:Apply LLM directives (if any);
:Evaluate each action's potential;
:Select highest-value action;

|Action Execution|
:Prepare action parameters;
:Select interaction method;
:Execute on device via UIAutomator;
:Monitor for completion;
:Handle timeouts;

|Result Processing|
:Capture resulting state;
:Determine action success;
:Measure state changes;
:Update memory system;
:Track progress metrics;

stop

@enduml